Package: digitalvalue
Title: Digital Initiatives Value Assessment
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Frenk", "Giorgetti", email = "frenk.giorgetti@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Shiny application, structured as an R package, to record digital
    initiatives and follow their value through the lifecycle: registration
    with RICE, 4M valuation (production, reserves, monetary, time), expert
    review, decision, execution and post-execution value audit with adoption.
    Calibrated regressions anticipate value from RICE and realised value from
    the ex-ante evaluation. User activity is logged and
    grouped into process phases to support process mining.
